# D3-EN-003: Protein versus sugar enzymes on the same gelatin sample
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
add v1 water 40mL
add v1 gelatin 1g
add v1 protease 0.05g
add v2 water 40mL
add v2 gelatin 1g
add v2 lactase 0.05g
add v3 water 40mL
add v3 gelatin 1g
wait 45min
look v1
look v2
look v3
inspect
